# Recommended Development Order

1. Integrate **FieldRegistry** into `Simulation`
2. Implement **gradient operators**
3. Implement **face interpolation**
4. Implement **second-order convection schemes**
5. Build generalized **convective and diffusive flux infrastructure**
6. Assemble the **momentum equation system**
7. Implement the **pressure correction equation**
8. Develop the **SIMPLE family of algorithms**
9. Extend to **transient solvers**
10. Add **turbulence models**
11. Expand into **multiphysics**
12. Strengthen **verification** (Richardson extrapolation, GCI, field-based verification)
13. Optimize **solver performance** (profiling, memory layout, sparse matrices, SIMD)
14. Add **engineering optimization** capabilities
15. Develop **geometry and topology optimization**
